-- 4.1 lists the insurer's rights. They are carried by the rules they enable: 4.1.3 by the
-- cover decision (bvvcx-claim.l4), 4.1.5 by subrogation (5.2.8, 15.1.3(a)), 4.1.6 by
-- Article 15. 4.1.6 lets the CERTIFICATE set reduction rates as well as the Rules; where a
-- certificate does, the settlement declines (`The policy`'s `the certificate states
-- reduction rates of its own`), because those rates are not in the document.

