-- src:203 | được hồ sơ yêu cầu bồi thường đầy đủ, hợp lệ từ Người được bảo hiểm; không
-- src:204 | quá ba mươi (30) ngày trong trường hợp BẢO VIỆT phải tiến hành xác minh
-- src:205 | hồ sơ;
-- src:206 | Trong trường hợp BẢO VIỆT không đủ thẩm quyền để xác minh các yếu tố
-- src:207 | trong hồ sơ thì hồ sơ bồi thường được coi là đầy đủ và hợp lệ sau khi có kết
-- src:208 | luận chính thức của cơ quan chức năng có thẩm quyền. Sau chín mươi (90)
-- src:209 | ngày kể từ ngày BẢO VIỆT có văn bản đề nghị cơ quan chức năng có thẩm
-- src:210 | quyền tiến hành xác minh mà chưa có kết quả xác minh thì BẢO VIỆT phải
-- src:211 | chủ động tiến hành xem xét giải quyết bồi thường trên cơ sở tài liệu, chứng cứ
-- src:212 | thu thập được;
-- 4.2.3: pay within 15 days of receiving a complete and valid file; not more than 30 days
-- where the insurer must verify it. Where the insurer lacks authority to verify, the file
-- counts as complete once the competent authority concludes, and 15 days run from then
-- (fork F16). If 90 days pass after the insurer's written request with no conclusion, the
-- insurer "must proceed to consider" the claim on what it has: the Rules set no time for
-- that, so the encoding declines to give one (finding X7).
@ref Rules, Article 4.2.3 (src 206-212)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`4.2.3 sets no time for paying a claim the competent authority has not concluded on` MEANS
    REFUSE "4.2.3 sets no time for paying a claim the competent authority has not concluded on"

@ref Rules, Article 4.2.3 (src 206-210)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the record does not say when the insurer asked the competent authority to verify` MEANS
    REFUSE "the record does not say when the insurer asked the competent authority to verify"

@ref Rules, Article 4.2.3 (src 202-212)
GIVEN `the file` IS A `The claim file`
GIVETH A DATE
`4.2.3 — the last day for the insurer to pay on` `the file` MEANS
    IF   `the file`'s `the insurer lacks authority to verify some element`
    THEN CONSIDER `the file`'s `date the insurer asked the competent authority to verify`
         WHEN NOTHING THEN `the record does not say when the insurer asked the competent authority to verify`
         WHEN JUST `the request` THEN
             CONSIDER `the file`'s `date of the competent authority's official conclusion`
             WHEN JUST `the conclusion` THEN `the day` 15 `days after` `the conclusion`
             WHEN NOTHING               THEN `4.2.3 sets no time for paying a claim the competent authority has not concluded on`
    ELSE IF   `the file`'s `the insurer has to verify the file`
         THEN `the day` 30 `days after` (`the file`'s `date the complete and valid file was received`)
         ELSE `the day` 15 `days after` (`the file`'s `date the complete and valid file was received`)

-- The 90-day mark after which the insurer must act on what it has.
@ref Rules, Article 4.2.3 (src 208-212)
GIVEN `the date of the request` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`4.2.3 — the day after which the insurer must decide on the evidence it has` `the date of the request` MEANS
    `the day` 90 `days after` `the date of the request`

@ref Rules, Article 4.2.3 (src 202-205); clock in days from receipt of the complete, valid file
GIVEN `the insurer has to verify the file` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act under the Rules`
`4.2.3 — the insurer pays` MEANS
    PARTY `the insurer`
    MUST  `pay the compensation`
    WITHIN (IF `the insurer has to verify the file` THEN 30 ELSE 15)
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the insurer` BECAUSE "4.2.3: compensation not paid within 15 days (30 where the file had to be verified) of receiving a complete and valid file"

-- src:213 | 4.2.4 Trường hợp từ chối bồi thường, BẢO VIỆT phải gửi văn bản nêu lý do từ chối
-- src:214 | bồi thường trong thời hạn mười lăm (15) ngày kể từ ngày BẢO VIỆT nhận
-- src:215 | được đầy đủ hồ sơ bồi thường hợp lệ;
@ref Rules, Article 4.2.4 (src 213-215)
GIVEN `the date the complete and valid file was received` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`4.2.4 — the last day for a written refusal` `the date the complete and valid file was received` MEANS
    `the day` 15 `days after` `the date the complete and valid file was received`

@ref Rules, Article 4.2.4 (src 213-215); clock in days from receipt of the complete, valid file
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act under the Rules`
`4.2.4 — the insurer gives its reasons for a refusal` MEANS
    PARTY `the insurer`
    MUST  `send a written refusal stating the reasons`
    WITHIN 15
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the insurer` BECAUSE "4.2.4: no written refusal with reasons within 15 days of receiving a complete and valid file"

