-- A permission ("có thể", may), for serious accidents, on request, once liability is
-- established. "Serious" and "especially serious" are not defined (finding X13).
@ref Rules, Article 4.2.5 (src 216-219)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act under the Rules`
`4.2.5 — the insurer may advance part of the necessary costs` MEANS
    PARTY `the insurer`
    MAY   `pay the compensation`
    HENCE FULFILLED

