@ref Rules, Article 5.2.4(a) (src 258-261)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act under the Rules`
`5.2.4(a) — after a refusal to reduce the premium, the purchaser may end the contract` MEANS
    PARTY `the purchaser`
    MAY   `end the contract by written notice`
    HENCE FULFILLED

